 			<blockquote epub:type="z3998:letter">
 				<p epub:type="z3998:salutation">“My dear Mentor⁠—</p>
 				<p>“Please make my adieux to your aunt, and exult within yourself, for ‘Lazy Laurence’ has gone to his grandpa, like the best of boys. A pleasant winter to you, and may the gods grant you a blissful honeymoon at Valrosa! I think Fred would be benefited by a rouser. Tell him so, with my congratulations.</p>
-				<p epub:type="z3998:valediction">“Yours gratefully, <span epub:type="z3998:signature">Telemachus</span>.”</p>
+				<footer role="presentation">
+					<p epub:type="z3998:valediction">“Yours gratefully, <span epub:type="z3998:signature">Telemachus</span>.”</p>
+				</footer>
 			</blockquote>
 			<p>“Good boy! I’m glad he’s gone,” said Amy, with an approving smile; the next minute her face fell as she glanced about the empty room, adding, with an involuntary sigh⁠—“Yes, I <em>am</em> glad, but how I shall miss him!”</p>
 		</section>
